  "labelNotes": "Supply voltage taken from Recommended Operating Conditions (VCC 1.1 to 5.5 V). The Electrical Characteristics also print 'VCC Range' 1.0 MIN / 5.5 MAX (p4); the 1.0 V minimum differs from ROC and was NOT labelled because the guide sources this field from ROC when one exists - doubtful case. ICC condition 'Vth + 0.2V' is not a number, omitted; column placement (30 TYP, 40 MAX) confirmed with pdftotext. ROC 'VIN Input Voltage 0 to (VCC+0.3)' is the MR input range, not a supply. Abs max: VCC '-0.3~7' gives 7 V; VRESET is an expression/output; ICC 20 mA is a current rating."
